{"version":1,"content":"<p>就宏福苑大火成立的獨立委員會上周四（22日）向行政長官提交報告。</p><p>據了解，報告內容最快明日（29日）公開，料特首李家超將率領官員舉行記者會，交代全面改革的計劃。</p><p>據悉周五亦將設記者會，由相關官員詳述相關改革工作。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T10:38:20.543222+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":106,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T05:22:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T22:18:10.006414+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T10:38:20.543222+00:00","content_hash":"97c1674adbe10a7d5c876bcd1acb4b287e06a2469f96577b8a0e699e87792533","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}